            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention provides synthetic fibres with advantageous properties such as high tensile strength and which can be produced by recombinant biotechnological means. The invention also provides the constituent components from which the fibres are assembled, along with fabrics formed from the synthetic fibres. Items comprising the fibres and fabrics of the invention are also included.</p>
